&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay Curious:&lt;/strong&gt; You ask questions that change how we do things and spot ideas to grow assets or fee income in new ways; you keep a genuine pulse on market conditions, competitor activity and investor appetite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Generous:&lt;/strong&gt; You share your network and market knowledge freely, and help more junior colleagues develop their deal and credit skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thoughtful Action:&lt;/strong&gt; You balance commercial acumen with risk management, identifying issues and pain points ahead of time and simplifying complexity for others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pull Together:&lt;/strong&gt; You collaborate across Credit, RST and Management, staying aware of the team&#39;s capacity constraints and stepping in to help where useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own It:&lt;/strong&gt; You take full accountability for your transactions and portfolio, acting as a steward of Triple Point&#39;s capital from origination through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
