&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A positive, can-do, commercial attitude with a solution-oriented approach to problems and challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work independently and drive progress within tight timeframes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable to evolving priorities in a dynamic, multi-stakeholder environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commitment to professional standards, integrity, confidentiality and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working under Risk and Compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
