&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordinate cross domain discovery and delivery for features that support key journeys, aligning requirements where needed (eg. billing, quoting and energy insights).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and manage detailed product requirements for features related to country-specific needs to support energy products and pricing.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
