&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Build smarter ways of working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Contribute to improving account management processes, reporting and automation so the team can scale its impact while maintaining a high level of service.&lt;/div&gt;
